  "name": "hele-shaw-cells-example",
  "description": "Blueprint-aligned instance repository for the Hele-Shaw cells benchmark of the NFDI4IngModelValidationPlatform. Contains a 2D OpenFOAM-v2112 simulation of radial viscous fingering in a circular Hele-Shaw cell (air injected at the centre displacing a viscous soap solution), with the VOF interface captured by the isoAdvector scheme and surface tension via the continuum-surface-force model. Three parameter configurations (reference, mesh refinement, flow-rate variation) form a minimal convergence + sensitivity study.",
